["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">垣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>围墙；篱笆；栅栏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">垣根</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かきね</span><span class=\"k-wz\">篱笆；围栏；界限；分界线</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">欺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>欺骗；欺诈；蒙骗</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あざむ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欺く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あざむく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欺骗；迷惑；欺瞒；愚弄；堪比……；不亚于……；宛如……（如“明亮如白昼”“美若玫瑰”）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">詐欺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欺诈；诈骗；贪污；作弊；骗术；骗局；言而无信；承诺不兑现；放鸽子</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">釣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>钓鱼；引诱；找零</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.る・つ.り・つ.り-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">釣る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">钓鱼；垂钓；捕捉；引诱；诱惑；吸引；勾引</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">釣</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"j