/div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>架设；悬挂；支撑；架子；构造</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.ける・か.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">架空</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">虚构的；想象的；虚幻的；编造的；架空的；高架的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">担架</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">担架；轻便担架；推床</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鬼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>鬼；恶魔</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おに・おに-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鬼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鬼；妖怪；魔鬼；亡灵；幽灵；凶恶之人；冷酷无情之人；（捉迷藏、捉人游戏等中的）鬼；追逐者；鬼宿（二十八宿之一）；非常；极其；超级</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">庶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>庶民；众多；庶出（非嫡出）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">庶民</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょみん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平民；百姓；普通民众</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">庶務</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">庶务；总务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">稚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>幼小；幼稚；不成熟</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ・ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いとけない・おさない・おくて・おでる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幼稚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幼儿期；婴幼儿期；幼稚的；原始；未成熟</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幼稚園</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようちえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幼儿园；幼稚园</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">滋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>滋养；繁茂；更加；种植；浑浊</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ・シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">幻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>幻影；幻觉；虚幻；幽灵；梦幻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まぼろし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">煮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>煮；烹煮</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">に.る・-に・に.える・に.やす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煮る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">煮；炖；熬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煮える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被煮熟；被烹熟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">姫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>公主</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひめ・ひめ-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誓</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>发誓；宣誓；立誓</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ちか.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誓う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちかう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发誓；宣誓；立誓；承诺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">把</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>一把（量词，用于成捆物品）；束（捆扎成把的东西）；抓握</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハ・ワ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">把握</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はあく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">掌握；把握</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">践</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>践踏；踩；实践；履行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">実践</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じっせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">实践；付诸实践；实施；实践（作为社会活动的）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">呈</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>呈送；展示；赠送；发送；呈现</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">進呈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">呈献；赠送；奉献</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">疎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>疏远；稀疏；粗疏；避开；疏漏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ・ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うと.い・うと.む・まば.ら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疎か</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おろそか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">疏忽；疏漏；粗心；懈怠</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過疎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かそ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人口稀少；人口密度低；人口减少</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">仰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a cl