ss=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">征服</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">征服；制服；攻克；克服；攻克；掌握</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">砕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>粉碎；打碎；破碎；压碎；通俗</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くだ.く・くだ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くだく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">打碎；粉碎；压碎；研磨；捣碎；摧毁（希望、信心等）；使破灭；挫败；简化；使通俗易懂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くだける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破碎；碎裂；粉碎；崩溃；瓦解；衰退；减退（如热情）；消沉（如斗志）；变得不拘礼节；打破拘谨；变得随和；变得浅显易懂；通俗化；感到担忧；感到不安</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">謡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>歌唱；歌谣；谣曲（能乐）；吟唱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うた.い・うた.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歌謡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">歌曲；歌谣</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">民謡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みんよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">民间歌曲；民歌；通俗歌曲</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">嫁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>新娘；嫁入；出嫁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よめ・とつ.ぐ・い.く・ゆ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">嫁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">新娘；儿媳；媳妇；妻子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">花嫁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はなよめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">新娘</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">謙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>谦逊；自谦；谦恭；谦让</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">へりくだ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謙虚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谦虚；谦逊；虚心</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謙遜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんそん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谦虚；谦逊；谦让</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">謙る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へりくだる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贬低自己、褒扬对方；自我贬抑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">后</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>皇后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ゴ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きさき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">嘆</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>叹息；哀叹；悲叹；呻吟；赞叹</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt>